# Clutter generate/compile deny list.
#
# Every entry needs a reason and permanence:
#   TEMPORARY — corridor/mock stand-in; undeny + wire when that work lands
#   PERMANENT — hand override owns the body, GIR/Vala/ABI clash, or
#               non-marshallable; not deferred RPC
# Prefer TEMPORARY unless the symbol will not later become a generated stub.
#
# ************************************************************************
# TEMPORARY — revisit / undeny when implementing (keep this block together)
# ************************************************************************

# Generator: GString returns (GLib.String maps poorly).
FrameClock.get_max_render_time_debug_info

# Array wire mapping missing (noop keeps C symbol).
PaintNode.add_rectangles noop
PaintNode.add_texture_rectangles noop
ActorBox.from_vertices noop
Actor.get_abs_allocation_vertices noop

# Mock a11y: GenericAccessible has no rpc_lid. Undeny when Atk peers leased.
Actor.accessible
Actor.get_accessible
Actor.set_accessible

# ************************************************************************
# PERMANENT — not deferred RPC work
# ************************************************************************

# --- Hand override owns GIR prop/method (generator must not emit) ---

# Vala forbids a property identifier {@code type} (even {@code @type}).
# GIR construct-only InputDeviceToolType; get_tool_type stays generated.
InputDeviceTool.type

