# LayoutManager.override — GJS subclasses (QuickSettingsLayout, …) are
# client-owned; child meta / set_container stay local (no rpc_lid).
# layout_changed: deny RPC method (name clash with GIR signal). C symbol for
# GJS is LayoutManager.override layout_changed_invoke [CCode cname=…].
# allocate / get_preferred_*: RPC wrappers; rpc_lid==0 = GJS chain-up no-op.
# GJS real work is *_vfunc (Actor.allocate calls allocate_vfunc locally).
LayoutManager.allocate
LayoutManager.get_preferred_width
LayoutManager.get_preferred_height
LayoutManager.child_set_property
LayoutManager.child_get_property
LayoutManager.get_child_meta
LayoutManager.find_child_property
LayoutManager.set_container
LayoutManager.layout_changed

